      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the naming change Herb proposed, to refer to the main SkDevice of a SkCanvas as the root device. I can go either way: for something that\u0027s the bottom of the layer stack, both root and base convey similar information to me. Root conveys more \"tree\" connotations, which the stack of layers does end up producing when you look at the set of all operations going into a canvas.",
